('{"provider":"tmdb","externalId":"movie:299536","suggestedItemId":"m-tmdb-movie-299536","kind":"movie","type":"Filme","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/299536","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T18:02:39.546Z","attribution":{"name":"TMDB","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org","termsUrl":"https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/faq"},"metadata":{"titles":{"en":"Avengers: Infinity War","pt-BR":"Vingadores: Guerra Infinita"},"descriptions":{"en":"As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.","pt-BR":"Homem de Ferro, Thor, Hulk e os Vingadores se unem para combater seu inimigo mais poderoso, o maligno Thanos. Em uma missão para coletar todas as seis pedras infinitas, Thanos planeja usá-las para infligir sua vontade maléfica sobre a realidade."},"year":"2018","originalLanguage":"en","genres":["Adventure","Action","Science Fiction"],"cast":[{"id":3223,"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man"},{"id":16828,"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America"},{"id":74568,"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor"},{"id":16851,"name":"Josh Brolin","character":"Thanos"},{"id":103,"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / Hulk"},{"id":1245,"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow"},{"id":1896,"name":"Don Cheadle","character":"James Rhodes / War Machine"},{"id":71580,"name":"Benedict Cumberbatch","character":"Doctor Strange"},{"id":1136406,"name":"Tom Holland","character":"Peter Parker / Spider-Man"},{"id":172069,"name":"Chadwick Boseman","character":"T''Challa / Black 